# l7a (earthai-l7a) crontab lines for the page-vector service (#6821, scripts/workers/vector-search). INSTALLED 2026-10-17 (phase 4, #6843) in root's
# crontab on l7a, beside the existing lines (backup first: crontab -l > /root/backups/crontab-<date>).
#
# Every 30 min: apply page_translations rows updated since the checkpoint (vectors in RAM, text in
# text/pages.sqlite; no index save), then a heartbeat that stamps last_delta_at.
# Every 2 h at :45, --reconcile: one ~1 min scan of every served page_id, adding what the service lacks and
# removing what Supabase no longer serves. NOT optional: updated_at is the Mongo source time, so most
# newly embedded rows are behind the checkpoint and only this pass finds them (4,055 of 4,736 in the
# first 26 h; sync-delta.mjs header, step 4).
# Each reconcile also compares the text store's fingerprints with Supabase's (byte lengths; header-only, so
# no slower), and replaces stale text (in-place edits leave updated_at alone; sync-delta.mjs step 5).
# 03:40 UTC: delta + reconcile --hash (md5 of every translation, which catches a same-length edit), then save a new generation (tmp + rename) and compare the row count with
# Supabase (exit 4 and a COUNT DRIFT line when the drift is above 0.1%).
# All three share one flock (text-fingerprints.mjs, run once by hand, takes it too), so the nightly save never overlaps a delta and no two deltas run at once; the
# half-hourly one skips (-n) when the lock is held, the nightly one waits up to 15 min for it.
# :10 and :40: freshness-check.mjs — ntfy sourcelibrary-uptime once per state change when the service is
# down, the last delta is older than 2 h, the last reconcile older than 6 h, or the row count drifts more
# than 0.5% from the reconcile's Supabase count. It reads no database.
*/30 * * * * flock -n /tmp/vector-search-delta.lock systemd-run --quiet --scope --slice=sourcelibrary.slice /usr/bin/node --no-warnings --env-file=/root/sourcelibrary/.env.production.local /data/vector-search/app/sync-delta.mjs >> /data/vector-search/logs/delta.log 2>&1
45 */2 * * * flock -w 600 /tmp/vector-search-delta.lock systemd-run --quiet --scope --slice=sourcelibrary.slice /usr/bin/node --no-warnings --env-file=/root/sourcelibrary/.env.production.local /data/vector-search/app/sync-delta.mjs --reconcile >> /data/vector-search/logs/delta.log 2>&1
40 3 * * * flock -w 900 /tmp/vector-search-delta.lock systemd-run --quiet --scope --slice=sourcelibrary.slice /usr/bin/node --no-warnings --env-file=/root/sourcelibrary/.env.production.local /data/vector-search/app/sync-delta.mjs --reconcile --hash --save --count-check >> /data/vector-search/logs/delta.log 2>&1
10,40 * * * * flock -n /tmp/vector-search-freshness.lock systemd-run --quiet --scope --slice=sourcelibrary.slice /usr/bin/node --no-warnings --env-file=/root/sourcelibrary/.env.production.local /data/vector-search/app/freshness-check.mjs >> /data/vector-search/logs/freshness.log 2>&1
